      "en": "The friendship of the LORD is with those who fear him. He will show them his covenant.",
      "ko": "여호와의 친밀함이 경외하는 자에게 있음이여 그 언약을 저희에게 보이시리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "79d159bccc5b5286356e360ba3d3f3032776b84c81326d7c61d97dbd874e850d",
      "translation_text_hash": "02e8dea76f6fed97c91683eed4a49f35e8450896150d37305fdc6fa63c971594",
